/*
 * Declares the TypeInfo module. This module is responsible for validating and
 * constructing runtime values that describe the structure of types. These
 * values are used by the Ymir runtime(core::typeinfo) to provide reflection
 * capabilities such as:
 *
 *   - type identifiers,
 *   - size and alignment information,
 *   - field metadata,
 *   - and nested type information.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::typeinfo_
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/typeinfo_.yr
 * @Author(s):
